"Coach replies use Apple’s on-device model when available, or clearly labeled local guidance. Replies can be inaccurate. Coaching does not inspect photos, measure habit effects or calculate health scores." = "Coach replies use Apple’s on-device model when available, or clearly labeled local guidance. Replies can be inaccurate. Coaching does not inspect photos, measure habit effects or calculate health scores.";
