"When Apple’s system language model is already available and supports the selected app language, Coach uses your question, a limited summary of saved records and recent conversation excerpts on your device. Incomplete context is marked. The app does not attach photos or unverified historic AI notes, or read saved provider credentials for the request." = "When Apple’s system language model is already available and supports the selected app language, Coach uses your question, a limited summary of saved records and recent conversation excerpts on your device. Incomplete context is marked. The app does not attach photos or unverified historic AI notes, or read saved provider credentials for the request.";
"What you type is part of the request. Do not enter passwords or other secrets. The app makes no requests to a cloud AI provider and requires no API key or manual model download. When the model is unavailable, busy or too slow, replies may use clearly labeled local rules instead." = "What you type is part of the request. Do not enter passwords or other secrets. The app makes no requests to a cloud AI provider and requires no API key or manual model download. When the model is unavailable, busy or too slow, replies may use clearly labeled local rules instead.";
"Use Stop to cancel a reply. Leaving Coach or putting the app in the background also cancels the current request. Model replies can be inaccurate and do not automatically change your records." = "Use Stop to cancel a reply. Leaving Coach or putting the app in the background also cancels the current request. Model replies can be inaccurate and do not automatically change your records.";
"There is no Lumina account to delete. Local deletion does not close your Apple or storage-provider accounts." = "There is no Lumina account to delete. Local deletion does not close your Apple or storage-provider accounts.";

